== World Records ==
On 11 October 1992, Angus Hamilton set three world records with the car (Class 7) at the former [[RAF Elvington|Elvington airbase]] in the [[United Kingdom]]: quarter-mile, half-kilometer, and kilometer, in Category A3 Group 3.<ref>{{Cite web |title=LISTE OFFICIELLE DES RECORDS DE VITESSE HOMOLOGUES PAR LA FIA EN CATEGORIE A / OFFICIAL LIST OF SPEED RECORDS HOMOLOGATED BY THE FIA IN CATEGORY A |url=https://argent.fia.com/web/fia-public.nsf/D167033B0D09A227C125780E004ADA63/$FILE/Liste%20Records%20Cat%20A-040111.pdf |website=argent fia}}</ref>

